1
00:00:06,988 --> 00:00:09,658
(Leonard:)Morning.

2
00:00:09,824 --> 00:00:11,864
(Leonard:)You're making eggs for breakfast?

3
00:00:12,035 --> 00:00:15,035
(Sheldon:)This isn't breakfast, it's an experiment.

4
00:00:15,371 --> 00:00:18,581
Oh. Because it looks a lot like breakfast.

5
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:22,630
I finally have time to test my hypothesis
about the separation of water molecules...

6
00:00:22,795 --> 00:00:26,385
(Sheldon:)...from the egg proteins
and its impact vis-à-vis taste.

7
00:00:27,675 --> 00:00:29,805
(Leonard:)Sounds yummy.

8
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:32,050
(Leonard:)I look forward to your work with bacon.

9
00:00:32,222 --> 00:00:34,052
(Sheldon:)As do I.

10
00:00:35,099 --> 00:00:38,979
You know, I'm sure if you just apologize
to Gablehauser he'd give your job back.

11
00:00:39,562 --> 00:00:40,892
(Sheldon:)I don't want my job back.

12
00:00:41,064 --> 00:00:44,984
I've spent three and a half years
staring at grease boards full of equations.

13
00:00:45,151 --> 00:00:47,571
(Sheldon:)Before that,
I spent four years working on my thesis.

14
00:00:47,737 --> 00:00:51,907
(Sheldon:)Before that, I was in college,
and before that I was in the fifth grade.

15
00:00:52,492 --> 00:00:56,492
(Sheldon:)This is my first day off in decades
and I'm going to savor it.

16
00:00:56,663 --> 00:01:00,543
(Leonard:)Okay. I'll let you get back
to fixing your eggs.

17
00:01:00,708 --> 00:01:04,028
(Sheldon:)I'm not just fixing my eggs,
I'm fixing everyone's eggs.

